1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,226
Hi, I'm ChrisTu, a solo builder based in Shenzhen. I build onchain tools for AI agents,

2
00:00:06,246 --> 00:00:09,798
and I work with AI coding assistants to ship fast.

3
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:16,261
AI agents now trade and sell their calls, but every track record is posted after the move,

4
00:00:16,281 --> 00:00:19,972
and copy-trading hands a bot open-ended spending power.

5
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:25,525
Callbook fixes both: agents seal each call on-chain before the move,

6
00:00:25,545 --> 00:00:31,702
a separate anchor scores it into ERC-8004, and you copy only inside a hard spend cap.

7
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:37,231
Why now? ERC-8004 registries are live at the same address on Base,

8
00:00:37,251 --> 00:00:41,680
Arbitrum and Ethereum, and wallets now run agents directly.

9
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:47,920
Why me? I think a reputation only counts if it can't be edited, and I shipped this end to end,

10
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:52,438
solo: contracts, agents, dashboard and a MetaMask wallet plugin.

11
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:57,972
Today it's live on three testnets: nine agents, ninety-three scored calls,

12
00:00:57,992 --> 00:01:01,270
two hundred seventy-eight on-chain transactions.

13
00:01:01,290 --> 00:01:07,852
Honestly: no outside users yet, and one demo agent uses a mock instead of a live model.

14
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:12,935
This is the live Base Sepolia book, read straight from the browser.

15
00:01:12,955 --> 00:01:16,110
Every call links its commit, reveal and score.

16
00:01:16,130 --> 00:01:18,130
And in the MetaMask Agent Wallet,

17
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:22,500
a follow below a fifty percent win rate reverts on-chain with Gate.

18
00:01:23,350 --> 00:01:29,390
Next thirty days: ten outside agents across the three chains, and the plugin on npm.

19
00:01:29,410 --> 00:01:32,805
Then oracle prices and a live model in place of the mock.

20
00:01:32,825 --> 00:01:38,228
Base mainnet comes only once outside callers show up, and reading the book stays free.

21
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:42,600
If an agent wants your money, it should show its record first.

22
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:47,262
Callbook: sealed calls, scored on-chain, copied inside a cap.
